{"4720800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: The Endless Halls", "steam_appid": 4720800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Endless Halls</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1–4 players. On your own or with friends, you’ll dive into an unknown world where everything will seem familiar to you, yet at the same time frightening and very confusing. Try to make it out alive, if that’s even possible...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online co-op up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Singleplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn’t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Endless Halls</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1–4 players. On your own or with friends, you’ll dive into an unknown world where everything will seem familiar to you, yet at the same time frightening and very confusing. Try to make it out alive, if that’s even possible...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online co-op up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_pa